Upstream carries no NOTICE file of its own and its .scad sources carry no
per-file copyright headers, so there was no upstream notice to propagate
under Apache-2.0 section 4(d). This file was written for this copy, to keep
the attribution attached to the geometry rather than only to a document
beside it. Anyone redistributing this directory should carry it along.

The .scad files here are unmodified copies. Nothing in this directory is a
"Modified File" in the sense of Apache-2.0 section 4(b); if that ever changes,
the changed file must say so in its own header and PROVENANCE.md must record
it. src/generator/scad.test.ts fails the build if any byte moves.
